    "diagnosis": "Inflammatory myofibroblastic tumour of the uterus",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "This lesion, resected with a clinical impression of a \"fibroid\", displays a mixture of myxoid and fascicular areas. In the former, spindle cells are individually dispersed in a myxoid stroma and admixed with inflammatory cells (fasciitis or tissue culture-like). In non-myxoid areas, the tumour is more cellular and has a fascicular appearance.",
    "source": "Carlos Parra-Herran",
